      "comment": "Sohreh: Sohreh's Note",
      "content": "A moss-covered page from a research log, torn out and left in the cave behind the Ruin Golem in Ardravi Valley. In it Sohreh admires the jungle's biodiversity, mentions that the Withering was already touching the area without yet threatening it, and names new micro-scarabs \"Nahidad Scarabs\". She grumbles that Zandik's rigid Darshan shares nothing with Amurta, then notes a good discussion on plant and animal evolution and a picnic planned for that night.",
