      "comment": "Sohreh: The death of Sohreh",
      "content": "Records found around Sumeru piece together her end: Zandik's repeated unauthorised actions, her injuries from tigers, an attack by a Damaged Ruin Guard, her burial, and later an autopsy that found a fractured hyoid bone and \"mechanical asphyxia\" without determining a cause. Zandik was suspected but nothing is proven.",
